---
/**
 * Credits for third-party work used on the site. Rule: only assets whose licence allows use here
 * (CC0, or CC-BY with credit), and every one is listed below, credited or not.
 */
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const SOFTWARE = [
	{ name: 'Astro', href: 'https://astro.build', license: 'MIT' },
	{ name: 'React', href: 'https://react.dev', license: 'MIT' },
	{ name: 'three.js', href: 'https://threejs.org', license: 'MIT' },
	{ name: 'React Three Fiber', href: 'https://github.com/pmndrs/react-three-fiber', license: 'MIT' },
	{ name: 'drei', href: 'https://github.com/pmndrs/drei', license: 'MIT' },
	{ name: 'camera-controls', href: 'https://github.com/yomotsu/camera-controls', license: 'MIT' },
];
---

<PageLayout title="Credits" description="Credits and licences for the models, textures, data and software behind this site.">
	<h1>Credits</h1>

	<section>
		<h2>Textures and lighting</h2>
		<p>
			The lamp and the polaroids are generated in code. The surfaces and the room's reflections
			come from these, all released under CC0 (no credit required, given gladly):
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<a href="https://ambientcg.com/view?id=Wood051">Wood 051</a> by ambientCG: the desk's
				colour, normal and roughness maps
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="https://ambientcg.com/view?id=Paper001">Paper 001</a> by ambientCG: the
				polaroids' normal and roughness maps
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="https://polyhaven.com/a/small_empty_room_1">Small Empty Room 1</a> by Sergej
				Majboroda, Poly Haven: the HDRI the scene reflects, downsampled to 512×256
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Map data</h2>
		<p>
			The map on the desk is drawn from <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com">Natural Earth</a>
			(public domain), via the <a href="https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas">world-atlas</a>
			package, in the Natural Earth projection with <a href="https://d3js.org/d3-geo">d3-geo</a>.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Fonts</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<a href="https://github.com/googlefonts/caveat">Caveat</a> by Pablo Impallari, for the
				handwriting <span class="license">(SIL Open Font License 1.1)</span>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Open-source software</h2>
		<ul>
			{
				SOFTWARE.map(({ name, href, license }) => (
					<li>
						<a href={href}>{name}</a> <span class="license">({license} licence)</span>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
	section {
		max-width: var(--prose-width);
		margin-top: var(--space-8);
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
	}

	section > * + * {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}

	ul {
		padding-left: var(--space-6);
	}

	.license {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}
</style>
